# Base: apply after 0099.
#
# Authority v15:
#   - every older parity/residency/dual-GPU predicate remains
#   - recorded-group hot path must be nonblocking when timeline is enabled
#   - resident speculative accept path must execute
#   - verified-hidden timeline handoff must execute when timeline is enabled
#   - speculative verification must demonstrate real multi-token amortization
#   - three independent steady output runs must each remain >=85 verified TPS
#
# No benchmark number is minted by this patch itself.
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0100_85tps_authority_v15_waitfree_verified.patch

